sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  U->>C: Fill sales order form and save
  C->>A: POST /api/sales-orders (with token)
  A->>A: Verify token
  A->>D: Read employee permission
  D-->>A: salesOrders = write
  A->>D: BEGIN transaction
  A->>D: Read stock of each product
  D-->>A: Stock levels

  alt Quantity exceeds stock
    A->>D: ROLLBACK
    A-->>C: 400 Not enough stock
    C-->>U: Show error message
  else Stock is sufficient
    A->>D: Insert order and line items
    A->>D: Reduce product stock
    A->>D: Insert stock ledger entries
    A->>D: COMMIT
    A->>D: Insert activity log entry
    A-->>C: 201 Created (order)
    C-->>U: Show success and new stock
  end
